# ── MARK LV — what never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
config/api_keys.json          # your Gemini API key, plus per-plugin credentials
config/certs/                 # the dashboard's TLS private key and certificate
config/whatsapp_web/          # a LINKED WhatsApp session — committing it hands
                              # somebody your WhatsApp account, not just a key
**/token*.json                # Google OAuth tokens (Gmail / Calendar plugins)
**/client_secret*.json        # Google OAuth client secrets
*credentials*.json
*secret*.json
secrets.json
.env
.env.*
paritok.yaml

# ── Flutter / Mobile build artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────
.dart_tool/
**/android/local.properties
**/android/.gradle/
**/ios/Flutter/flutter_export_environment.sh
**/ios/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/ios/Flutter/Generated.xcconfig
**/windows/flutter/ephemeral/

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
memory/*.db

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/
Workshop_latest_x64_en-US.msi.zip
OAuth client ID.apps.googleusercontent.com.json
config/api_keys.json

# ── Local model checkpoints & large weights (>100MB exceeds GitHub limit) ─────
models/
*.safetensors
*.pt
*.pth
*.bin

# ── Temporary, tool results, caches, archives and backups ─────────────────────
.manus/
unsloth_compiled_cache/
dist_installer/
*.zip
*.apk
tests/_*
memory/*.backup*
